tion_Grenade_SporesToxic+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Explodes into a virulent cloud which can inflict Noxious Fumes Condition upon creatures within.\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Aoe Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>Creates area: Noxious Fumes</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Area:_Noxious_Fumes\"> Area: Noxious Fumes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes\" title=\"Noxious Fumes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp/45px-Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp/60px-Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Noxious_Fumes_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes\" title=\"Noxious Fumes\">Noxious Fumes</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 2 m (7 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 2 m (7 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n<p>Chance to affect creatures with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Bibberbang)_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Bibberbang) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Bibberbang)_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Bibberbang) (Condition)\">Noxious Fumes</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Cloud</a></dd>\n\n</dl><h3><span id=\"Condition:_Noxious_Fumes_.28Bibberbang.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Noxious_Fumes_(Bibberbang)\"> Condition: Noxious Fumes (Bibberbang) </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Bibberbang)_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Bibberbang) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Bibberbang)_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Bibberbang) (Condition)\">Noxious Fumes</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> each turn. It must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Constitution Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or take an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a>, taking half damage in a success.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> </span>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores\" title=\"Sublimate of Poison Spores\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores_Item_Icon.png/30px-Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores_Item_Icon.png/40px-Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Poison_Spores\" title=\"Sublimate of Poison Spores\">Sublimate of Poison Spores</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Spore\" title=\"Poison Spore\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Poison_Spore_Item_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Spore_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Poison_Spore_Item_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Spore_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Poison_Spore_Item_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Spore_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Poison_Spore_Item_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Spore_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Poison_Spore_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Spore\" title=\"Poison Spore\">Poison Spore</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Ashes</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage is not applied in the first turn.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage is applied every turn. Its DC is 15, and it can be applied multiple times if a creature moves in the fumes.</li>\n<li>When the grenade explodes, the blast can do <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">2d4 + 1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage; this is a spell attack.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202457\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.110 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.115 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4579/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 72076/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 17545/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1445954/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   93.161      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   93.161      1 -total\n 44.61%   41.558     15 Template:Icon_text\n 42.56%   39.652     65 Template:Trim\n 25.86%   24.090      1 Template:PageSeo\n 25.78%   24.017      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 22.35%   20.822      8 Template:Icon_link\n 18.76%   17.475      1 Template:Area_full\n 14.64%   13.642      1 Template:Area_full/format\n 14.40%   13.416     19 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:9647-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202457 and revision id 387094. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}